  "prefLabel": "Hedc 502.05 Renewal of Scholarships",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hedc 502.05 Renewal of Scholarships.\n\n(a) Scholarships may be renewed up to 3 times after the initial award, for a maximum of 4 total awards.\n\n(b) Scholarships shall be eligible for renewal for no more than 4 years, or until the recipient attains the age of 26 years, whichever occurs first.\n\nSource. #14213, eff 3-12-25 (formerly Hedc 501.07)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/hedc500.html"
